      "result_text": "I tightened the intro paragraph of `/brief.md` and saved it as v3. The rest of the file is unchanged.\n\n**Before:**\n> Tandem is a shared workspace where a team keeps its canonical files and its project context in one place, and where every teammate can keep using their own AI assistant, which reads and updates those files through a remote MCP server. This brief is the starting point for anyone who is joining the project, and it should be read before any other document, because it explains what we are building, why we are building it, and what is deliberately out of scope for the version that we are going to demo at Cal Hacks 13.0.\n\n**After:**\n> Tandem is a shared workspace where a team keeps its canonical files and project context in one place, and where each teammate can use their own AI assistant to read and update those files through a remote MCP server. Read this brief before any other document: it explains what we are building, why, and what is out of scope for the Cal Hacks 13.0 demo.\n\nI read `/brief.md` at v2 and saved v3. The save is live for teammates now, and I didn't publish or propose anything.",
